# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Applied at edge before the SPA loads.
#
# docs.orangerails.com is referenced from the marketing site's nav,
# footer, and several /docs pages as the integrator knowledge base.
# The dedicated docs site is on the roadmap (Phase 4) but does not
# exist yet, so the canonical docs content for now lives at
# orangerails.com/docs/* inside the main SPA. These rules send every
# request that lands on the docs.* host to the matching path on the
# main host. Status 302 (NOT 301) is deliberate: 301 is cached
# indefinitely by browsers and intermediaries, which would keep
# routing visitors here even after the dedicated docs site replaces
# this redirect. 302 keeps the redirect transitional.

https://docs.orangerails.com/* https://orangerails.com/docs/:splat 302
https://docs.orangerails.dev/* https://orangerails.dev/docs/:splat 302
